{"id":"odu-teardown-crash","ord":"a0","title":"Investigate: a lost ssh connection kills the whole odu run at teardown","done":"2026-08-29T12:16:00-04:00","desc":"The human's word, 2026-08-29 (~11:38): dispatch an agent to investigate with evidence. Observed by the #427 CI watcher: kolu-ci-9's ssh keep-alive dropped mid-e2e and odu's teardown crashed with repeated uncaught `logTail: append after log ended` exceptions for finished nodes — the whole live run died (history lost, rerun target gone), instead of the one node erroring. Deliverable: root cause with evidence, reported to the orchestrator; no issue or PR without the human's further word.","created":"2026-08-29T11:39:30-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T12:16:00-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/odu-teardown-crash.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T11:39:00-04:00","terminal":"8be497af","worktree":".worktrees/investigate-teardown-crash"}}
